  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Stir in the ground cumin, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the rinsed and drained red lentils, vegetable broth, and optional cheddar cheese to the pot.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 30 minutes, or until the lentils are tender.",
    "Remove the pot from the heat and let it cool slightly before serving.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs, if desired."
  ],
